From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Publish accounting snapshots atomically and merge only validated data

Validate complete input and reserve merge capacity before changing live
counters. Publish a synced temporary inode by same-directory rename and
report directory-sync failure independently of publication. Preserve an
existing period encoding and defer shutdown saves to the native event loop.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
